<title>POLAND: AMERBANK APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.85  vs    0.69</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.68  vs    1.15</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.77  vs    3.06</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 6.66  vs    4.05</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.20  vs    2.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    5.51  vs    3.86</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 17.31  vs   11.91</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	23.03  vs   15.99</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Amerykanski w</p>
<p>Polsce Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
